        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0OtdMRsvDZaBqK5pj_PGAtRCNsNl3R5GW4iSrdQTMow1xJvzPlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "As always, Dr. Lussier is warm, welcoming, attentive, & extremely knowledgeable in his approach & execution. 10 years ago I began suffering with debilitating lower back pain that ultimately led to permanent nerve damage. But with the help of Dr. Lussier who gave me tools & advocated for my recovery, I have now gone 4 years without incident. Literally a life saver.",
        "time": 1768481203,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chantal Jomphe",
