        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Omg! Thank you Dr. Dos Santos! She is amazing! Saw results super fast! Should have gone before. Don’t hesitate. Go see her or any of the other 3 chiros at NOVA chiro in Vaudreuil.",
