      {
        "author_name": "Sonja Stuut",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105754320284906968121/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWKC7pzO7WNybvZm0HTqxRsHQtBFEq1ahmfN1rIoq317bJdyUib=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Beautiful people work here!!\nVery professional environment. Receptionists are really kind and helpful. Myrriam Vézina, D.C,  is stellar!!! Compassionate and caring. She a multitude of techniques to help you! She has alleviated much of my herniated disc pain. This office has one of the very few SpineMED® Decompression tables, the latest evolution in non-surgical decompression technology! Highly recommended. Thanks to this great team!! 🌺🌻🙂",
        "time": 1706051843,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
